{"id":1145241,"xmlId":"org.editorconfig.editorconfigjetbrains","name":"EditorConfig","description":"<p>Handles properties in <i>.editorconfig</i> files and applies them to all supported languages in all JetBrains IDEs.\n\n    </p><h2>Features</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Code assistance for all supported properties, standard and extended\n    </li></ul>\n    <h2>Getting started</h2>\n    <p>For more information,\n    check the documentation for <a href=\"https://editorconfig.org/\">EditorConfig</a> files and your <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/\">IDE</a>.</p>\n<h2>Getting started</h2>\nSimply put your .editorconfig file(s) in place according to the instructions at editorconfig.org site, and the plugin will enforce them. EditorConfig settings will silently override the normal settings configured in the IDE for all files controlled by EditorConfig. That is, if your IDE's settings say to use 4-space indents in Java files, but your EditorConfig settings enforce 2-space indents in all the files under the &quot;src&quot; directory, then hitting tab will insert 2 spaces on Java files in &quot;src&quot;, but 4 spaces in all other Java files in the project.","organization":"JetBrains s.r.o.","tags":["Formatting"],"version":"262.10315.19","dependencies":["com.intellij.modules.lang"],"optionalDependencies":["intellij.editorconfig.frontend","intellij.platform.frontend","intellij.spellchecker","intellij.editorconfig.backend","intellij.rd.client","intellij.editorconfig.common","intellij.platform.backend","intellij.platform.frontend.split"],"since":"262.10315","until":"262.*","size":667413,"vendor":"JetBrains","sourceCodeUrl":"https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community/tree/master/plugins/editorconfig","depends":["com.intellij.modules.lang"],"content":[{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.common","namespace":"jetbrains"},{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.frontend","namespace":"jetbrains"},{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.frontend.split","namespace":"jetbrains"},{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.backend","namespace":"jetbrains"},{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.backend.spellchecking","namespace":"jetbrains"}],"modules":[{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.common"},{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.frontend","moduleDependencies":[{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.platform.frontend"},{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.common"}]},{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.frontend.split","moduleDependencies":[{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.platform.frontend.split"},{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.frontend"},{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.rd.client"}]},{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.backend","moduleDependencies":[{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.common"},{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.platform.backend"}]},{"moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.backend.spellchecking","moduleDependencies":[{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.backend"},{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.editorconfig.common"},{"type":"module","moduleName":"intellij.spellchecker"}]}]}